#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 550
#: rc.cpp:89
msgid ""
"If you have more than two layouts and turn this option on, switching with "
"the keyboard shortcut or clicking on the kxkb indicator will only cycle "
"through the last few layouts. You can specify the number of layouts to "
"rotate below. You can still access all layouts by right-clicking on the kxkb "
"indicator."
msgstr ""
"Si vos avoz pus di deus adjinçmints d' definis et ki vos metoz cisse tchuze "
"ci en alaedje, li discandje avou l' tape rascourti oudonbén tot clitchant so "
"l' imådjete di l' aplikete di kxkb va catourner seulmint emey les kékes "
"dierins adjinçmints. Vos ploz dner l' nombe d' adjinçmints d' taprece a "
"catourner dvins. Vos ploz todi aveur accès a tos les adjinçmints tot "
"clitchant avou l' boton d' droete so l' aplikete kxkb."

